### STEP 1 - Place a new order (in order-service)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userEmail": "gudurukhasim@gmail.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "iPhone 15",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 79999.00
    }
  ]
}

###

### STEP 2 - Check payment was processed
GET http://localhost:8084/api/payments

###

### STEP 3 - Check order status updated (replace ORD-XXXXXXXX)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/orders/ORD-XXXXXXXX

###

### STEP 4 - Check payment by order number
GET http://localhost:8084/api/payments/order/ORD-XXXXXXXX